  "title": "Delhi Protests Amid 'Cockroach' Movement Reactions",
  "summary": "Delhi witnessed a series of protests led by the Cockroach Janta Party (CJP), demanding the resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar, with thousands detained and security measures enforced. The government emphasized strict enforcement to address the situation.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Thousands of security personnel have been deployed in Delhi ahead of a major protest by the Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) demanding the resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Supreme Court dismissed a plea against a public figure’s renovation, and protesters continue to demand accountability.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The leaders of the Cockroach Janta Party, an Indian youth movement, had been detained by the police on Saturday before they could lead protests over voting rights.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
